=================
 Rotating Arrows
=================
using graphics, turtle

	prepare #arrows :
		#arrows : a group of 36 turtles in (a turtle space in (a graphics window))
		'angle' : 0
		#arrows pens up
		for each 'arrow' in #arrows
			'arrow' colour  (random colour)
			'arrow' heading ('angle' increment by 10)
		move #arrows RADIUS steps
	
	move 'arrows' around the circle :
		'arrows' speed 5
		turn 'arrows' -90 degrees
		repeat 180 times
			move 'arrows' (2π × RADIUS ÷ 180) steps
			turn 'arrows' -2 degrees

	remove 'arrows' :
		'arrows' speed 10
		for each 'arrow' in 'arrows'
			turn 'arrow' -90 degrees
		move 'arrows' RADIUS steps
		hide 'arrows'
		
-----------------------------------
RADIUS : 300

prepare 'arrows'
move 'arrows' around the circle
remove 'arrows'
